            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaka wartość zostanie wyświetlona przez ten kod?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Sarah.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indeksy ujemne pozwalają liczyć wstecz od końca listy, przy czym <code>-1</code> oznacza ostatni element.</p><p>Prześledź działanie indeksu <code>-3</code> w kodzie. Który członek zostanie wyświetlony?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Anna</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Gareth</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Sarah.</p></body></html>"
